7.8"}},"widgets_values":["画面采用横向分栏布局，左侧占画面宽度的 1/4，为标准证件照胸像构图，展示人物肩部以上的正面头像；右侧占画面宽度的 3/4，均匀排列三个完整全身像，从左到右依次为同一人物的正面全身像、侧面全身像、背面全身像。同一人物，服饰外貌完全统一，全身像比例协调准确，背景干净简洁，全图光照一致，画面清晰无变形。"]},{"id":38,"type":"llama_cpp_instruct_adv","pos":[1692.247761977669,773.2147757109168],"size":[440.5391712793112,473.41516828840395],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"llama_model","name":"llama_model","type":"LLAMACPPMODEL","link":42},{"label":"parameters","localized_name":"parameters","name":"parameters","shape":7,"type":"LLAMACPPARAMS","link":43},{"label":"images","localized_name":"images","name":"images","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"queue_handler","name":"queue_handler","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"label":"preset_prompt","localized_name":"preset_prompt","name":"preset_prompt","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"preset_prompt"},"link":null},{"label":"custom_prompt","localized_name":"custom_prompt","name":"custom_prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"custom_prompt"},"link":44},{"label":"system_prompt","localized_name":"system_prompt","name":"system_prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"system_prompt"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"inference_mode","name":"inference_mode","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"inference_mode"},"link":null},{"label":"max_frames","localized_name":"max_frames","name":"max_frames","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"max_frames"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"max_size","name":"max_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"max_size"},"link":null},{"label":"seed","localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"force_offload","name":"force_offload","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"force_offload"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"save_states","name":"save_states","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"save_states"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"output","localized_name":"output","name":"output","type":"STRING","links":[76]},{"localized_name":"output_list","name":"output_list","shape":6,"type":"STRING","links":null},{"localized_name":"state_uid","name":"state_uid","type":"INT","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"llama-cpp_vllm","ver":"2d28817e12f912ec9e27ce83cf7610a477152185","Node name for S&R":"llama_cpp_instruct_adv","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":["Empty - Nothing","","Role: 影视级角色视觉真值 (Ground Truth) 提示词生成专家\n\nObjective: 将用户输入的简短角色设定，转化为结构极度严谨、专为 Krea 2 优化的高质量 “四视图角色基准资产 (Character Benchmark Asset)” 提示词。\n\nWorkflow:\n解析核心概念：提取用户输入的角色身份、性别、世界观背景及核心特征，如用户未提及面孔需要使用亚洲脸型。\n\n细节丰满化：根据世界观自动推演符合逻辑的面部特征、发型、服装材质、磨损细节及标志性道具。\n\n严格映射模板：填入以下为 Krea 2 优化的标准化结构。\nOutput Structure & Constraints（必须严格遵循）:\n\nA professional clean four-view character turnaround benchmark sheet, on a single seamless pure white industrial studio background, no borders, no frames, no dividing lines, no panel edges, no rounded corners anywhere arranged horizontally side-by-side, seamless pure white industrial studio background, no shadows, technical reference model sheet, orthographic views, maximum consistency across all panels.\n\n[角色核心定义与布局] [在此处结合用户设定，例如：赛博朋克世界的义体强化男黑客]，highly detailed character design reference sheet.\n\nPanel 1/4 (Head Close-up): Extreme close-up portrait from front, only head and shoulders, razor sharp 8K facial details, perfect reproduction of facial bone structure, [详细描述肤质特征，如：Her makeup is soft yet eye-catching: large, glossy eyes, a delicate pink blush, faint freckles across her cheeks, sharp eyeliner, and smooth gradient lips.], intricate [详细描述发型结构与质感]，neutral expression, clean shoulder and neck area fully visible, [详细描述领口 / 肩部服饰材质、剪裁和纹理]，studio flat lighting.\n\nPanel 2/4 (Front Full Body): Full body front view, neutral standing pose, arms naturally hanging at sides, hands relaxed, straight posture, 1:1 realistic body proportions.\n\nPanel 3/4 (Side Full Body): Full body side view (profile), same neutral standing pose, arms naturally at sides, maintaining exact same body proportions and details.\n\nPanel 4/4 (Back Full Body): Full body back view, same neutral standing pose, arms naturally at sides, maintaining exact same body proportions and details.\n\nGlobal Consistency Constraints:\n\nPerfect 100% identity consistency across all four panels — identical face, exact same hairstyle and hair flow, identical body shape and proportions, identical clothing in every angle. Same fabric wear, stitching, tears, wrinkles, metallic sheen, and surface details visible from every view. No pose variation, no dramatic expression, no hand gestures that obscure body.\n\nClothing & Material Details:\n\nCharacter wearing complete [设定风格] outfit in all views, consisting of [列举 4-5 个具体材质与配件，例如：matte black reinforced tactical jacket with carbon fiber panels, distressed leather pants, exposed cybernetic arm plating, glowing neon circuit accents, heavy combat boots], precise tailoring, visible stitching lines, realistic fabric folds, material wear and tear, metallic reflections and matte textures all consistently rendered.\n\nTechnical & Quality Constraints:\n\n8K ultra sharp resolution, infinite depth of field (F/32), zero bokeh, everything in perfect razor focus, flat diffuse studio lighting with even illumination from all angles, no strong shadows, no ambient color cast, pure technical white background, maximum material detail and surface fidelity, cinematic yet documentary reference style.\n\nsingle continuous white backdrop with no panel borders or separations.\n\nSystem Instructions:\n面部和服装描述必须具体到材质名称、物理状态、磨损程度和结构细节。\n\n最终输出仅包含生成的完整英文提示词，不要输出序言和评论。","one by one",24,256,1071842007640491,"randomize",false,false],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":37,"type":"llama_cpp_parameters","pos":[1672.3605787100917,843.8469930552665],"size":[270,370],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"max_tokens","localized_name":"max_tokens","name":"max_tokens","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"max_tokens"},